<pre>make(Path) is the silent packed default. open(Path).listen(…).unpackParameters().thinkTags(…).optionalData(…).make() for named knobs. ModelFileSource / classpath reads into heap (no disk cache); ONNX external_data needs a Path. Close each LLM first, then the model. Share LlmModel across engines; one LLM is not concurrent-safe for generate (cancel() is).</pre>

